   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2011-11-02.CMC-8s** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 131 min [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader says it was recorded somewhat hot, yet still sounds really nice to him [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2011-11-02.CMC-8s**: taped by Evangeline; transferred by Humbug; source: Aud->SP CMC-8s+AT-P12106 hyper-cardioid caps->SPSB-6S(r/o:0)->Edirol R09(16bit 44.1Khz, gain +18) [1]. Also: Recorded by Evangeline from the audience using CMC-8s with hyper-cardioid caps into an Edirol R09 at 16-bit 44.1kHz; Humbug transferred it via Audacity and CD Wave to FLAC, only trimming and tracking it; Evangeline had given him her old R-09 [1]",
